{
  "uid": "vankoo-logs",
  "title": "Vankoo · Logs",
  "tags": [
    "vankoo"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-3h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Dashboards de Vankoo",
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "vankoo"
      ],
      "asDropdown": true
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Cómo leer este dashboard",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Logs de **todos los pods** del namespace `vankoo`, que Alloy recoge de su salida estándar y guarda en Loki (48 h). El nivel (`level`) se deduce de cada línea. Filtra con las variables de arriba; en el panel de logs, las líneas de los servicios Java traen `trace_id`: el botón **Ver traza** abre la petición completa en Tempo. Consulta libre: *Explore → Loki*, por ejemplo `{namespace=\"vankoo\", app=\"invoicing-service\"} |= \"OCR\"`."
      },
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Volumen de logs por servicio",
      "description": "Líneas por minuto de cada servicio. Un salto repentino suele acompañar a un error en bucle o a un pico de tráfico.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 60,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (app) (count_over_time({namespace=\"vankoo\", app=~\"$app\", level=~\"$level\"} [1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{app}}"
        }
      ],
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Errores por servicio",
      "description": "Líneas con nivel error o fatal por minuto. Más de 20 en 5 min sostenido dispara VankooErrorLogsSpike.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 60,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (app) (count_over_time({namespace=\"vankoo\", app=~\"$app\", level=~\"error|fatal\"} [1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{app}}"
        }
      ],
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Servicios con más errores (rango seleccionado)",
      "description": "Total de líneas de error por servicio en el rango de tiempo del dashboard.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (app) (count_over_time({namespace=\"vankoo\", app=~\"$app\", level=~\"error|fatal\"} [$__range]))",
          "queryType": "instant",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "reduce",
          "options": {
            "reducers": [
              "lastNotNull"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sortBy",
          "options": {
            "sort": [
              {
                "field": "Last *",
                "desc": true
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 4,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Logs",
      "description": "Últimas líneas con los filtros de arriba. Despliega una línea para ver sus etiquetas y, si tiene trace_id, el enlace a la traza.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "dedupStrategy": "none"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "{namespace=\"vankoo\", app=~\"$app\", level=~\"$level\"} |~ \"$search\""
        }
      ],
      "id": 5,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 11,
        "w": 16,
        "h": 20
      }
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "app",
        "label": "Servicio",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "loki",
          "uid": "loki"
        },
        "query": {
          "label": "app",
          "stream": "{namespace=\"vankoo\"}",
          "type": 1
        },
        "definition": "label_values({namespace=\"vankoo\"}, app)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "refresh": 2
      },
      {
        "name": "level",
        "label": "Nivel",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "error,warn,info,debug,unknown",
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "options": []
      },
      {
        "name": "search",
        "label": "Texto (regex)",
        "type": "textbox",
        "query": "",
        "current": {
          "text": "",
          "value": ""
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
